SUMMARY:Schiaparelli: Fashion Becomes Art
DESCRIPTION:The UK’s first Schiaparelli exhibition spans the 1920s to t
 oday. It explores the fashion house’s origins and Daniel Roseberry’s
  contemporary evolution.\nPrice: Weekday £28.00 / Weekend £30.00\; con
 cessions apply\; members visit free\nhttps://www.londonmuseumtours.com/t
 emporary-exhibitions
LOCATION:The Sainsbury Gallery\, Cromwell Road\, London\, SW7 2RL\, South
  Kensington\, London
URL:https://www.londonmuseumtours.com/temporary-exhibitions
END:VEVENT
